DuelingGroundsAdvanceCourse3:
SET_ACTIVE 0
COUNTER_CHECK 2
SVAL 2 1
BNE 0x100 0xc 2
//load level 2 here
FADI 10
CALL GroundsResetUnit
LOAD1 0 DuelingGroundsTier3Wave2
ENUN
COUNTER_ADD 2 1
GOTO 0x105
LABEL 0x100
SVAL 2 2
BNE 0x101 0xc 2
//load level 3  here
FADI 10
CALL GroundsResetUnit
LOAD1 0 DuelingGroundsTier3Wave3
ENUN
COUNTER_ADD 2 1
GOTO 0x105
LABEL 0x101
SVAL 2 3
BNE 0x102 0xc 2
//load level 4 here
FADI 10
CALL GroundsResetUnit
